            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili na pa ba mu lupwa lobe, aba mubili no mulopa obe, abo waifyalila we mwine, bakasendapo bamo no kuya bacita bamutungwi abakubombela imfumu ya ku Babiloni kwisano lyaiko.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.18",
