        },
        {
          "text": "Hesekia ayasuka ati, “Ishiwi lyakwa Yawe ilyo walanda lisuma.” Pantu atontonkenye ati, “Bushe emukuti takwakatale akuba umutende no kucingililwa mu nshita ya bumi bwandi?”",
