              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo palwa fintu fimbi ifya pa bufumu bwakwa Hesekia, fyonse ifyo abombele, kabili ifyo apangile icishiba nefyo aimbile umufolo wakuleta amenshi mu musumba, bushe tafyalembwa mu citabo ca milandu ya shamfumu sha bena Yuda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
